3️⃣ Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF)

OWASP: A01 – Broken Access Control

⚔️ Attack Scenario

Victim logged into DVWA

Attacker sends malicious link

Password changes without consent

Sample Malicious HTML
<form action="http://dvwa/change_password.php" method="POST">
<input type="hidden" name="password_new" value="hacked123">
<input type="submit">
</form>
🛡️ Mitigation

CSRF tokens

SameSite cookies
$_SESSION['token'] = bin2hex(random_bytes(32));
